  "description": "Office worker Jeong Ra-Won has a humble dream: to make it through the workweek and enjoy his days off in peace. Unfortunately, he is just one drunk younger brother away from having his desires utterly crushed. After picking up his wasted sibling at a gay bar, he runs into his company boss, Hyeon Je-O, who soon takes an interest in Ra-Won despite his claims of not being gay himself. As if Je-O’s display of workplace harassment isn’t bad enough, Ra-Won is forced to go off on a long business trip with him to Jeju Island, which requires him to give up his precious weekends! Will Ra-Won’s once peaceful Sundays ever be recovered?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
